    "text": "<p>Number of Geometrical Isomers in square planar <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> are <math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math> According to CFT,&nbsp;configuration is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mn>221</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>00</mn></msubsup></math>;&nbsp;it means number of unpaired electron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So spin-only magnetic moment<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.73&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CFSE</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.4</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>nt</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.6</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>eg</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0.4</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2.0</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math></p>",
